{
  "$comment": "Change sets attribute an object without a tool id to the nearest object holding it that has one, through list and tree fields and refs declared `owns`, run by kition-kdm (tests/changes.rs) and @kition/kdm (test/changes.test.ts). Each case starts from `setup` numbered as a kit numbers tool ids (testing::number_tool_ids), runs `edit`, numbers again, and expects `expected` both from the receipt (Replica::changes_since / changesSince) and from the comparison of the whole states named by tool ids (diff_states + with_tool_ids / diffStates + diffWithToolIds, less its `texts`); `texts`, when given, is that comparison's `texts`. An attributed edit's `field` is the path from the holder (field names and positions joined by `.`); a created one's `after` and a deleted one's `before` are its values; a moved one's `before` and `after` are its paths.",
  "docId": "01920000-0000-7000-8000-0000000000d2",
